<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on 6-month Swiss franc LIBOR.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on 6-month Swiss franc LIBOR.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS says it has issued 60 million European-style cap warrants, in six equal tranches, on six-month Swiss franc LIBOR.</p>
<p>One warrant controls 100.00 Sfr nominal.</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   17.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> WARRANTS	  STRIKE	   ISS PRICE	    MATURITY</p>
<p> TRANCHE A	 3.00 PCT	 2.46 SFR	     31.DEC.99</p>
<p> TRANCHE B	 4.00 PCT	 1.36 SFR	     31.DEC.99</p>
<p> TRANCHE C	 5.00 PCT	 0.77 SFR	     31.DEC.99</p>
<p> TRANCHE D	 3.00 PCT	 5.81 SFR	     29.DEC.01</p>
<p> TRANCHE E	 4.00 PCT	 3.52 SFR	     29.DEC.01</p>
<p> TRANCHE F	 5.00 PCT	 2.12 SFR	     29.DEC.01</p>
<p>NOTES	     LINKED TO COMPLICATED FORMULA</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
